        title: 'Tip',
        description: "If an opponent's visible upcards already beat your entire 5-card potential, fold immediately.",
      },
      {
        title: 'Tip',
        description: 'Position matters less than board texture. A player with two visible Kings is the lead, regardless of their seat position.',
